	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nWDioqZ5t9fCu9tJ5",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 10, DX 12, IQ 11, HT 12, HP 10, WILL 15, PER 13, FP 14, SPEED 6, MOVE 12, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYUiaOjW34Ma25RD5",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 30 (offense 21, protection 9), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nlK2u8WGC_zn6mWBU",
			"text": "Horrifying Visage: No attack roll and no active defense. Horrifying Visage (14): 1d-4 toxic, Reach Ranged, gaze. The face it wears when it stops pretending to be what it was. A Fright Check at penalty; those who fail are staggered by terror, and the young can be aged by it."
		},
		{
			"id": "ntZ7Z8gjUblWl67pp",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/ghost.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nX72mbCzM6ML2v33n",
			"text": "Independent build total: 566 points of racial traits plus 12 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nObH8O6hZVDSowMj_",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Ghost (SRD 5.1); Ghost (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nX5BEaByJwUvo0Ah3",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "n3Gpn8WIAbqrDX1lT",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: null kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nP4NpJGDDmxwxM4jp",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6; air Move 12 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "n-nW5U0S_I0USlKIU",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nvLfYwyjN6NgZBelw",
			"text": "Insubstantiality is bought with Affect Substantial: the touch works on the living, and walls, armor and grapples do not work on it. Weapons need magic or the spirit's own terms to bite; Diffuse injury tolerance carries that."
		},
		{
			"id": "nJVD4N63ANmcnDjop",
			"text": "Massless and hovering; movement is flight at a walking pace."
		},
		{
			"id": "nmlDwLVos_u4a3xeT",
			"text": "What binds it to the site is story, not points, and the record deliberately does not price an unfinished purpose."
		},
		{
			"id": "nevFdJjKdrmahGsBj",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
